<title>NORWAY: Dyno 1996 operating result per division.</title>
<headline>Dyno 1996 operating result per division.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operating result per division for Norwegian explosives, chemicals and plastics company Dyno Industrier ASA for the twelve months to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>	   (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>   Explosives			228	 vs	  91</p>
<p>   Chemicals			 227	 vs	 498</p>
<p>   Plastics			   69	 vs	  73</p>
<p>   Particles			   9	 vs minus  19</p>
<p>   Fuel tank systems		--	 vs	  36</p>
<p>   Finance/real estate	     8	 vs	   5</p>
<p>NOTE -- Dyno said earnings per share for 1996 would be 8.26 crowns versus 13.53 crowns a year ago. The board would propose a dividend of four crowns per share.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
